-#     - "Palette length stays small (2-4), filled sprite count stays small (1-2), and exactly one distractor nested sprite remains unfilled."
-#     - "Inner-border colors may repeat across sprites, but they never overlap palette keys; this keeps the rule inferable without exploding color count."
