 # Dimension: D4 — 源对象——空心精灵的形状与结构 (src)
 # Change: 空心精灵具有单色边框，内部为背景色（0），形状不规则（非严格矩形），边框可能有缺口或突出部分... → 多层嵌套精灵——外框色查调色板填充中间层
 
-# Design analysis
-# ---
-# variant_spec:
-#   core_change:
-#     from: "single-border hollow sprites whose entire enclosed hole is filled"
-#     to: "two-layer nested sprites with an outer border, an inner border, and a blank center; only the annulus between the two borders is filled"
-#   concrete_object:
-#     - "Each sprite is a rectangular nested frame."
-#     - "Outer border uses one solid color."
-#     - "Inner border uses a different solid color that is never a palette key."
-#     - "The cells between outer and inner borders form a bg annulus in the input."
-#     - "The cavity inside the inner border stays bg in both input and output."
-#   behavior_trace:
-#     input_example:
